{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.KZ.FuchsianConvergence","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Calculus.SmoothSeries","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Exponential","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Deriv","lean:module:Mathlib.Analysis.Normed.Ring.InfiniteSum"],"declarations":15,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.kz_hasDerivAt","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.kz_hasDerivAt","kind":"theorem","line":237,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L237-L254","doc":"**The KZ solution normalised at `0`.** For any residues `A, B` and the normalised formal\nsolution `H` (unique under non-resonance, `QOU.KZ.FuchsianFormal.kz_formal_solutions`),\n`G(t) = H(t) t^A` solves `G' = (A/t + B/(t−1)) G` on `(0, 1)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.series_kzM0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.series_kzM0","kind":"theorem","line":223,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L223-L235","doc":"`M(t) = A − (t/(1−t)) B` for the KZ coefficients. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.boundedOn_kz_solution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.boundedOn_kz_solution","kind":"theorem","line":214,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L214-L221","doc":"The normalised formal solution of the three-point KZ system converges on `|t| < 1`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.boundedOn_kzM0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.boundedOn_kzM0","kind":"theorem","line":201,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L201-L211","doc":"The coefficient sequence of the three-point KZ system has bounded coefficients. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.hasDerivAt_solution","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.hasDerivAt_solution","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L183-L196","doc":"**The local solution at a regular singular point.** If `H` is the normalised formal solution\nand both `M` and `H` converge on `|t| < r`, then `G(t) = H(t) t^A` satisfies\n`G'(t) = t⁻¹ M(t) G(t)` on `(0, r)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.hasDerivAt_tpow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.hasDerivAt_tpow","kind":"theorem","line":179,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L179-L181","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.tpow","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.tpow","kind":"def","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L176-L177","doc":"`exp(log t · A)`, i.e. `t^A` for `t > 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.gauge_series","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.gauge_series","kind":"theorem","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L148-L174","doc":"**The gauge equation for the sums**: `t H'(t) + H(t) A = M(t) H(t)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.summable_norm_n_series","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.summable_norm_n_series","kind":"theorem","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L130-L146","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.smul_deriv_series","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.smul_deriv_series","kind":"theorem","line":119,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L119-L127","doc":"`t · ∑ n t^{n-1} H_n = ∑ n t^n H_n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.hasDerivAt_series","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.hasDerivAt_series","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L100-L116","doc":"**Termwise differentiation** of `H(t) = ∑ t^k H_k` inside the radius of convergence. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.summable_deriv_bound","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.summable_deriv_bound","kind":"theorem","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L77-L96","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.summable_norm_of_bounded","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.summable_norm_of_bounded","kind":"theorem","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L61-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.BoundedOn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.BoundedOn","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L52-L54","doc":"`H` has radius of convergence at least `r`, in the form produced by `bounded_weighted`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.series","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.KZ.FuchsianAnalytic.series","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/KZ/FuchsianAnalytic.lean#L49-L50","doc":"The sum `H(t) = ∑ t^k H_k`. ","signatureChunk":0}]}